cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PDB-AI in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "PDB-AI"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for building analysis-ready structural biology datasets for
  artificial intelligence and machine learning from Protein Data Bank
  structures. PDB-AI preserves atom-level RCSB mmCIF records and enriches them
  through modular source and analysis engines. Current engines provide PDB-Redo
  comparisons, BDamage and Bnet radiation-damage scores, solvent accessibility,
  wwPDB validation data, UniProt mappings, and AlphaFold Database confidence.
  Each run emits a machine-readable manifest and a data dictionary suitable for
  citation as supplementary material.
type: software
